What's This?
~~~~~~~~~~~~
This is a TOP 10 List Generator for Zeus BBS..
Upload   (Files/Bytes) 
Download (Files/Bytes)
Messages
Calls
Dl Files


Contents Of Archive
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
MAX-TopGen       - The Program for UL/DL/Calls/Messages/Files
MBRS-TopGen      - The Program for MBRS UL/DL
ZEUS-TopGen      - The Program for Zeus BBS
TurboTop.DOC     - This doc file for the MaxBBS version.
TurboTop.txt     - A little script file for updating , max version.
TurboTopZeus.txt - A little script file for updating , zeus version. 
TurboTopZeus.Doc - This doc file you are reading now.

Usage
~~~~~
Run ZEUS-TopGen from CLI and you will see:

---------------------------------------------------
TurboTop v1.1(Zeus) (c) Christian Vigard / TurboSoft - 1996
Zeus Conversion by Mikael Hjerpe

Usage: TurboTop <Option> <OutPut>

Options:        U = Top Uploaders   (Files)
                D = Top Downloaders (Files)
                u = Top Uploaders   (Bytes)
                d = Top Downloaders (Bytes)
                C = Top Callers
                A = Top Authors
                F = Top Files
About/Info:     ? = For Some Information
----------------------------------------

Example:

TurboTop U RAM:TopUL.Text
'''''''' * ++++++++++++++

' = The Program

* = Top Uploaders

+ = Output File....

Pretty Easy? ;)


Show The "RAM:TopUL.Text" In Your BBS
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

CMD_1:
	SetStatus '"Showing Top File Uploaders"'
	ClrScr FORCE
	Display 'ram:TopUL.Text'
	WaitReturn
	Signal MenuLopp

CMD_2:
	SetStatus '"Showing Top Byte Uploaders"'
	ClrScr FORCE
	Display 'ram:TopByteUL.Text'
	WaitReturn
	Signal MenuLopp

CMD_3:
	SetStatus '"Showing Top File Downloaders"'
	ClrScr FORCE
	Display 'ram:TopDL.Text'
	WaitReturn
	Signal MenuLopp

CMD_4:
	SetStatus '"Showing Top Byte Downloaders"'
	ClrScr FORCE
	Display 'ram:TopByteDL.Text'
	WaitReturn
	Signal MenuLopp

CMD_5:
	SetStatus '"Showing Top Callers"'
	ClrScr FORCE
	Display 'ram:TopCallers.Text'
	WaitReturn
	Signal MenuLopp

CMD_6:
	SetStatus '"Showing Top Authors"'
	ClrScr FORCE
	Display 'ram:TopAuthors.Text'
	WaitReturn
	Signal MenuLopp

CMD_7:
	SetStatus '"Showing Top DL Files"'
	ClrScr FORCE
	Display 'ram:TopFiles.Text'
	WaitReturn
	Signal MenuLopp


Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
1. Move all the files to "Doors:TurboTop/"

2. Link keys for all the TopLists.Text's
   (Look At The "Usage" Part in this Doc)

3. HOW TO UPDATE LISTS:
   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
   I recommend that you run all the programs on a SYSEVENT.
	and when your computer is booting up. 

   You can do it like this:

   Type "Execute Doors:TurboTop/TurboTopZeus.txt"

   And woila you have fresh TopLists :)...

4. Edit the TurboTop.Txt so it suits you needs.

5. Now test all the programs so they are working...

They works perfect on my A3000/030/25..  ;)

History
~~~~~~~
1.0 - First Version.  

1.1 - Added TopFiles function, and it's only 2 program now instead of
      6 :), Lot's of KB's saved!!...   

1.1(Zeus) - I (Mikael Hjerpe) converted it to Zeus and added Top UL/DL 
            Files and Bytes in same exe file. 
            I also fixed so the Sysop is not displayed in the lists. 
